WEBVTT

00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:00.768
All relationships, if they are strong,

00:03:00.792 --> 00:03:03.309
have a foundational truth around trust.

00:03:03.333 --> 00:03:06.476
All relationships demand
responsibility and accountability,

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.726
communication, creativity.

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:15.184
So what changes is the context
where I explore the dynamics,

00:03:15.208 --> 00:03:16.726
and here I moved to work.

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:20.143
I looked at what are
these invisible forces

00:03:20.167 --> 00:03:22.976
that people bring with them to work

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:28.184
and that shape relationships around
conflict, communication, connection.

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:30.684
And it's the context that changes,